{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302170/extras/9536e7111d9618a1bae5295034228cb9.avif?t=1761687675\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302170/extras_big/9536e7111d9618a1bae5295034228cb9.avif?t=1761687675 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More stories. More secrets. More of what you love.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Platinum Extra Scenes</i> expands the world of <i>Shale Hill Secrets</i> with 43 brand-new, non-canonical playable scenes! Intimate, emotional, and sometimes wild moments that dive deeper into the relationships and mysteries you thought you already knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302170/extras/c9adabf90d435cc573f60fba674aca25.avif?t=1761687675\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extended dialogue, new character interactions, and exclusive storylines unavailable in the base game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>43 fully playable extra scenes</strong> \u2014 discover new chapters, alternate perspectives, and untold stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2,923 CGs</strong> crafted in stunning detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 interactive 360\u00b0 panoramas</strong> for a more immersive visual experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302170/extras/46a1255697d8445b14fac29bc4b90420.poster.avif?t=1761687675\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302170/extras/46a125569